{
  "subject": "You have been invited to ⁨Analytical Engines⁩ on Timlee",
  "text": "You have been invited to ⁨Analytical Engines⁩ on Timlee\n\n⁨owner@example.com⁩ has invited you to join ⁨Analytical Engines⁩ as ⁨bea@example.com⁩.\n\n⁨https://timlee.example/invite?token=secret⁩\n\nThe invitation expires at 6 Nov 2026, 09:30 (7 days from now) and can only be used once. Sign in with this address to accept it.\n\nIf you were not expecting this, you can safely ignore this email. Nothing happens until you open the link.\n",
  "html": "\u003c!doctype html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003ctitle\u003eYou have been invited to ⁨Analytical Engines⁩ on Timlee\u003c/title\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody style=\"font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111;\"\u003e\n  \u003ch1 style=\"font-size: 20px;\"\u003eJoin \u003cbdi\u003eAnalytical Engines\u003c/bdi\u003e on Timlee\u003c/h1\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbdi\u003eowner@example.com\u003c/bdi\u003e\u003c/b\u003e has invited you to join \u003cb\u003e\u003cbdi\u003eAnalytical Engines\u003c/bdi\u003e\u003c/b\u003e as \u003cbdi\u003ebea@example.com\u003c/bdi\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://timlee.example/invite?token=secret\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 16px; background: #111; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;\"\u003eAccept the invitation\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #555;\"\u003eOr paste this link into your browser:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbdi\u003ehttps://timlee.example/invite?token=secret\u003c/bdi\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #555;\"\u003eThe invitation expires at 6 Nov 2026, 09:30 (7 days from now) and can only be used once. Sign in with this address to accept it.\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #555;\"\u003eIf you were not expecting this, you can safely ignore this email. Nothing happens until you open the link.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n"
}
